.git
data/
dist/
**/dist/
# tsc -b trusts these: shipped without their dist/ (excluded above), they make the image's
# `pnpm build` a no-op that emits nothing, and `make generate` then finds no compiled CLI.
# The runner builds the workspace before `docker build`, so they are always in the context.
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.papi/
tests/
docs/
.github/
*.md
